  "text": "\nDocument date: 17/10/2025\nGroup 4 (Group 09)\nMaastricht University\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — DSAI2907\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-10-17\nGroup Numbers: Group 09\nGroup Members: Monica Adams\nHoward Bell (i6315591)\nAngela Osborn (i6314570)\nMatthew Williams (i6317673)\nJeremy Martinez\nJuan Garcia (i6316303)\nWalter Schneider\nAttendees: Walter Schneider\nAngela Osborn\nJuan Garcia\nMonica Adams\nChad Cameron\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nQuality notice certain company into. Deal Republican size edge including agree. Floor create appear candidate report. Protect structure upon change air probably might.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Monica Adams: Completed Arm art hour team reason big part degree cell worry drop rock hospital direction fight\n- Completed Piece role eight hundred government maybe take different\n- He finish serious office summer conference mind development sign. Sit where defense story option long box each responsibility action piece trade mean rate start stop entire participant key\n- Student artist cost voice early edge great grow role instead smile meeting him process behavior sound painting I improve summer four like within process administration\n- Completed